  "summary": "Track 27 research complete: proposes an additive, deterministic (non-LLM) executive-summary layer toggled inside the existing single-file offline HTML report (no schema.py/MetricResult change). Plain-language glossary for the Core Four defined; every exec claim anchor-links to its technical row (traceability contract). Explicitly inherits Track 26's non-verdict \"X of Y flagged for review\" framing rather than reintroducing pass/fail language — flags the existing badge-pass/badge-fail (p<0.05) styling in report.html.j2 as the concrete manifestation of the trap Track 26 is resolving. Recommendation: PROTOTYPE FIRST (build a static toggle prototype to validate offline-contract + traceability now; hold full generator.py wiring until Track 26's verdict-language is signed off by Aaradhya/Tisha, since Track 27 explicitly sits above it). Dependencies: Track 26 (verdict language, not yet merged — treated as pending proposal, not fact). Scope: ADJACENT EXTENSION, zero risk to M1 lock.",
